who will tell us how Keppel is using AgentCore in Keppel AI platform.

00:15:25.836 --> 00:15:27.076
Hello, everybody.

00:15:27.636 --> 00:15:29.636
Very good afternoon to all of you.

00:15:30.676 --> 00:15:35.356
It's a really a great honor for the both of us
to be invited on stage to share

00:15:35.356 --> 00:15:39.836
with you the solutions that we have built on top of AgentCore.

00:15:40.436 --> 00:15:47.196
My name is Brian, and I lead the digital
solutions team for the real estate division in capital.

00:15:48.076 --> 00:15:55.716
Over the last two years, there has been two major
transformation in capital from a conglomerate of companies.

00:15:56.276 --> 00:16:03.516
We are now a global asset manager with deep
operating capabilities and that includes digital.

00:16:05.076 --> 00:16:12.396
The second transformation is really the adoption
and the embedding of AI into our business segments,

00:16:12.556 --> 00:16:16.436
as well as our business processes. In 2025,

00:16:16.476 --> 00:16:23.676
we spent a whole year building up the foundation to allow AI

00:16:23.796 --> 00:16:32.916
to coexist securely in capital,
and that includes controls, governance, Guardrails,

00:16:33.436 --> 00:16:36.356
and of course, not forgetting the data foundation.

00:16:36.356 --> 00:16:44.996
I'm going to let Kamel share with you what we did
at the Data foundation layer to enable Cai or capital R AI.

00:16:46.196 --> 00:16:51.356
Thanks, Brian. Hi guys. Hopefully you guys are not asleep just yet.

00:16:52.236 --> 00:16:58.796
Let me walk you through what Cai is and why we built it.

00:16:59.236 --> 00:17:06.316
So Cai exists because we work backwards
from a very real problem and not just AI hype.

00:17:06.876 --> 00:17:16.196
Across Keppel, teams were experimenting with AI tools, building
one off solutions, hard to scale, and the value was fragmented.

00:17:16.236 --> 00:17:21.756
We knew we wanted to build something enterprise grade way

00:17:21.756 --> 00:17:28.676
and something enterprise grade way systems
to turn data into decisions and AI into the capabilities.

00:17:29.116 --> 00:17:35.156
That's where Cai comes in. It sits
at the intersection of AI and human potential.

00:17:35.356 --> 00:17:43.196
It is powered by our AI factory,
which consists of nine composable modular engines designed

00:17:43.236 --> 00:17:48.796
to solve business problems end to end
and not just build one off solutions.

00:17:49.436 --> 00:17:53.716
Most critically, we set observability from the very start.

00:17:53.996 --> 00:18:02.756
Every AI powered data product that gets built
on Cai is measurable, traceable, and controllable.

00:18:03.036 --> 00:18:08.516
So we know what is working, why it's working, and when to intervene.

00:18:08.996 --> 00:18:15.676
So if Cai is how we industrialize AI at Keppel,
the next logical question is what is it built on?

00:18:16.036 --> 00:18:20.796
None of it is possible without the strong data foundations in place.

00:18:22.076 --> 00:18:28.636
And that's where Keppel Data Exchange,
or like we call Codex at Keppel comes into the picture.

00:18:30.476 --> 00:18:36.156
AI without quality data, as we all know, cannot, is hard to scale.

00:18:36.156 --> 00:18:41.076
In fact, it's impossible to scale.
It's like building a skyscraper on sand.

00:18:41.116 --> 00:18:45.676
No matter how advanced the design, it will not stand.

00:18:45.716 --> 00:18:49.356
You may move fast, but it won't get you anywhere useful.

00:18:49.876 --> 00:18:51.996
One of the core AgentCore principles.

00:18:51.996 --> 00:18:56.316
Like Puneet said, I remember it was a best practice number six.

00:18:57.236 --> 00:19:05.116
It emphasizes that the production ready AI agents require clean,
standardized and meaningful data.

00:19:05.116 --> 00:19:08.596
And that's exactly the reason why Codex exists.

00:19:08.796 --> 00:19:14.396
Data from across our enterprise
systems is ingested into our data warehouse,

00:19:14.516 --> 00:19:21.356
where it is cleaned and made available
at scale for analytics, reporting and to AI agents.

00:19:21.596 --> 00:19:30.036
